{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BLOOD VIAL\u00a0</i></strong>is a vampiric, retro-inspired FPS with a leaking health bar. Swim through the blood of your fallen enemies to keep your vial full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Holy Ones have gained control. Reach the sacred source of power draining you of your energy, and destroy it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive through spilled blood to climb walls, swim through grates, and leap over gaps. Learn to harness your blood powers to their maximum potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get messy with the shotgun, or execute with precision using the revolver. Unlock more weapons and experiment with your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal sacred pacts to gain power between each level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blood Vial</i>\u00a0<i>was inspired by Post Void, Splatoon and Ultrakill.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648730?t=1772959044","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648730?t=1772959044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648730/006ab94a4489953e9bb6e94f8b9b692ebeded7de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772959044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648730/006ab94a4489953e9bb6e94f8b9b692ebeded7de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772959044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood Vial contains stylized fantasy violence, including combat and exaggerated blood particle effects when enemies are defeated.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual acts, sexual violence, self-harm, or realistic injury."},"demos":[{"appid":4354920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BLOOD VIAL\u00a0</i></strong>is a vampiric, retro-inspired FPS with a leaking health bar. Swim through the blood of your fallen enemies to keep your vial full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Holy Ones have gained control. Reach the sacred source of power draining you of your energy, and destroy it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive through spilled blood to climb walls, swim through grates, and leap over gaps. Learn to harness your blood powers to their maximum potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get messy with the shotgun, or execute with precision using the revolver. Unlock more weapons and experiment with your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal sacred pacts to gain power between each level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blood Vial</i>\u00a0<i>was inspired by Post Void, Splatoon and Ultrakill.</i></p>","developers":["Dillon Steyl"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648730/0ee8c335a9f53276ca246d32d2acc697d25e3fd7/header.jpg?t=1772959044","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3648730/398700598/0e291533189ff8eaf1c776429be01ad391823c42/1771852645/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771853292","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3648730/398700598/0e291533189ff8eaf1c776429be01ad391823c42/1771852